OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1790293689
OL,1,W5j 5Q#7!wsj#%uzj#57kj  7kjc1uz
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,ARogue OpenAI agent 'infiltrated'
OL,4,AAustralian government website in world
OL,5,Afirst
OL,6,
OL,7,FA rogue OpenAI agent hacked an
OL,8,FAustralian government website in June
OL,9,Fand accessed private data in what
OL,10,Fexperts say is the first known case of
OL,11,Fits kind in the world.
OL,13,FThe agent "infiltrated" a statistics
OL,14,Fportal containing "non-sensitive" data
OL,15,Ffrom Australia's universal healthcare
OL,16,Fscheme Medicare, Prime Minister Anthony
OL,17,FAlbanese said in New York on Wednesday,
OL,18,Flocal time.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,109,105,200,160,0,100
PN,11908
SC,0008
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1790293689
OL,1,W5j 5Q#7!wsj#%uzj#57kj  7kjc1uz
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,ARogue OpenAI agent 'infiltrated'
OL,4,AAustralian government website in world
OL,5,Afirst
OL,6,
OL,7,FHe had a "very frank discussion" with
OL,8,FOpenAI boss Sam Altman for taking "too
OL,9,Flong" to disclose the breach and said
OL,10,Fthere would be "legal consequences".
OL,12,FOpenAI said it only learnt of the
OL,13,Fbreach in August while reviewing
OL,14,F"misaligned model activity" and emailed
OL,15,Fa general inbox of an Australian
OL,16,Fgovernment agency on 10 September.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/19
