OL,3,ARapper Macklemore announces 'Free
OL,4,APalestine' tour after Ed Sheeran
OL,5,Afallout
OL,6,
OL,7,FRapper Macklemore is launching a "Free
OL,8,FPalestine" tour, days after being
OL,9,Fdropped from Ed Sheeran's Loop Tour
OL,10,Ffollowing pro-Palestinian comments he
OL,11,Fmade onstage earlier this month.
OL,13,F"So, as you all know, my schedule freed
OL,14,Fup a bit," he said upon announcing the
OL,15,Ftour on Thursday.
OL,17,FThe American artist - whose real name
OL,18,Fis Benjamin Haggerty - said proceeds
OL,19,Ffrom the tour, which launches in Dublin
OL,20,Fnext month, will go to organisations
OL,21,Fsupporting Palestinians.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,164,160,200,105,0,100
PN,11915
SC,0015
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1790293689
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+j 55"k#j 5w;js1
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ARapper Macklemore announces 'Free
OL,4,APalestine' tour after Ed Sheeran
OL,5,Afallout
OL,6,
OL,7,FMacklemore's onstage comments and
OL,8,Fsubsequent removal from the tour led
OL,9,FSheeran's support acts to drop out,
OL,10,Fwhile the British singer stressed that
OL,11,Fthe decision to drop the rapper was
OL,12,Fmade by his promoter, not by himself.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG15/19
